OL,3,AFive reasons India's stock market is
OL,4,Asinking even when its economy is
OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndia's economy is growing at an
OL,8,Fenviable rate of over 7% despite global
OL,9,Fenergy shocks, rising interest rates,
OL,10,Ftariff uncertainties and
OL,11,Fweather-related disruptions.
OL,13,FBut the world's fastest growing major
OL,14,Feconomy also has one of the worst
OL,15,Fperforming major equity markets in
OL,16,F2026. The correction in Indian stocks
OL,17,Fhas, in fact, only intensified in
OL,18,Frecent weeks.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
