OL,3,AFive reasons India's stock market is
OL,4,Asinking even when its economy is
OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe benchmark Sensex and Nifty indices,
OL,8,Fwhich represent the country's largest
OL,9,Fcompanies, have inched up slightly
OL,10,Fsince Monday after posting losses for
OL,11,Feight straight weeks - the longest
OL,12,Flosing streak in 25 years, according to
OL,13,FReuters.
OL,15,FIndian mom-and-pop investors who put
OL,16,Ftheir money into the Nifty have seen
OL,17,Ftheir wealth erode by about 15% this
OL,18,Fyear. In comparison, they would have
OL,19,Fmade 62% returns on Korea's Kospi index
OL,20,Fsince January or 170% in the last two
OL,21,Fyears.
